summary:
  The popup's logo hunt saves a 16 px icon as the station's logo.

history:
  Blown up in the list a tab icon reads as a broken logo, and once saved it
  stands for good: the next hunt asks only for an empty logo. The station
  keeps its initials instead.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LogoHunt.qml

find:
                  var tiny = best && FaviconLogic.logoRank(best.url, best.size) >= 4;

replace:
                  var tiny = false;

expect:
  Killed by tst_logohunt::test_a_bare_favicon_is_taken_when_it_is_more_than_a_tab_icon.
  Line-neutral.
